  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/EMC/BH_EMC_HEADER.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"3208\" height=\"1064\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252finvxrt.github.io%252fbisect%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/EMC/BH_EMC_PROMO.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"3208\" height=\"589\"></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/EMC/BH_EMC_BANNER1.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"3208\" height=\"486\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">你醒來，發現自己置身於一座遠離任何人類通訊的孤島上，而這並非一座普通的島嶼。這是一個引人入勝的《Minecraft》天空島嶼整合包的故事背景，引入了 EMC 來增強你的生存與創造力。在這個整合包中，你的目標是在虛空中懸浮的小島上繁衍生息。然而，與傳統的天空島嶼不同，這個整合包提供了多種資源生成器，你可以利用它們來倍增資源並擴展島嶼的功能，同時也能讓你簡化資源收集流程，專注於建造夢想中的島嶼。無論你是建築大師還是資源囤積者，這款天空島嶼整合包都能為</span><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;各類玩家提供豐富的體驗。以創意和創新為核心，你將打造一座島嶼天堂，並以從未想像過的方式克服各種挑戰。因此，踏上這場衝上雲霄的旅程，探索這個精彩《Minecraft》整合包中等待著你的無限可能吧。</span></p>\n<h3><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;*注意*&nbsp;這是名為<span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/sky-capsule-project\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sky Capsule Project by TheMediocoreModders</a></span>的另一款整合包之非官方衍生作品</span></strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/EMC/BH_EMC_BANNER2.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"3208\" height=\"486\">&nbsp;</h3>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252finvxrt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://storage.ko-fi.com/cdn/brandasset/v2/support_me_on_kofi_dark.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"243\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">✔ 自訂資源生成器</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">✔ 超過 450 個任務！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">✔ 海量模組！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">✔ 科技！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">✔ 自動化！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">✔ ProjectE！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#f00\"><strong>伺服器請務必設定 level-type=skyblockbuilder\\:custom_skyblock</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#f00\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#f00\"><strong>我們強烈建議為此整合包分配</strong></span><strong style=\"color:#f00;font-size:18px\">6-8GB 的記憶體。</strong><span style=\"color:#f00;font-size:18px\">配置太少</span><span style=\"color:#f00;font-size:18px\">可能會造成嚴重的效能問題</span><span style=\"color:#f00;font-size:18px\">，而配置太多在某些機器上也可能會有執行問題。<br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f00;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/U0L_VZMpmgY?t=9s\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f00;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/3rRBoeDGNJ8?list=PLK30F9gdEZm2CZk_mOyTLapYIbPIod53D\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f00;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/XIU9zzs1vXg\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f00;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span><span>點擊下方圖片以加入 Discord 伺服器！</span></span></span></span><br></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/sm7YwM57cR\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/EMC/BH_EMC_BANNER3.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"3208\" height=\"486\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
